Creation ka flow (order matters)

Intermediate Root MG banao (parent = Tenant Root ID).
2nd level (Platform, Landing Zones, Sandbox, Decommissioned) — parent = Intermediate Root.
3rd level (Identity/Management/Connectivity, Corp/Online) — parent = unke upar wala.
Subscriptions ko leaf MGs se associate karo.
(Baad me) Azure Policy har MG scope pe assign hoti hai — yahi MG hierarchy ka asli faida.
Locks optional, critical MGs pe.




Resource	Kaam
azurerm_management_group
MG node khud banata hai (hierarchy)
azurerm_management_group_subscription_association
Subscription ko MG se jodta hai (modern, alag resource)
azurerm_management_lock
MG/sub/RG pe CanNotDelete ya ReadOnly lock
azurerm_resource_management_private_link
ARM ko private (internet ke bina) manage karne ka private link — advanced/connectivity
azurerm_resource_management_private_link_association